# The ability makes a delayed triggered ability that exists apart from the land (CR 603.7, ruling 2025-04-04): after it
# resolved Bot2 destroys Dalkovan Encampment with Wasteland, and Bot1's attack with the Ornithopter still makes two tapped
# and attacking Warriors, for Bot1 (Bot2 takes 2 combat damage). The Encampment is in Bot1's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Dalkovan Encampment
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Plains
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Wasteland
Plains x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Wasteland.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Dalkovan Encampment.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Dalkovan Encampment.Activate(Ability: Whenever you attack)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Wasteland.Activate(Ability: Destroy; Dalkovan Encampment)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Dalkovan Encampment
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Mox Pearl; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Ornithopter; Warrior Token; Warrior Token
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard = Dalkovan Encampment
